          "type": "text",
          "plain_text": "This one is for the artists. Most of the journal talks to people choosing art for a wall; this piece talks to the people who make it, because we're actively looking for new work and it seems fairer to say so in plain sight than to rely on the right printmaker stumbling across our footer.",
