    "has_children": false,
    "paragraph": {
      "rich_text": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "plain_text": "A small, curated print gallery: sixteen prints by four artists at the time of writing, sold to a mostly British and Nordic audience through an English-language shop. Everything here got in the same way, a person found it and a person said yes. Nothing arrives by feed or bulk upload, and we take on very few of the artists we look at. That's not gatekeeping for its own sake; in a collection this size every piece changes how the others read, so each new print has to survive the company it keeps.",
          "href": null,
          "text": {
            "content": "A small, curated print gallery: sixteen prints by four artists at the time of writing, sold to a mostly British and Nordic audience through an English-language shop. Everything here got in the same way, a person found it and a person said yes. Nothing arrives by feed or bulk upload, and we take on very few of the artists we look at. That's not gatekeeping for its own sake; in a collection this size every piece changes how the others read, so each new print has to survive the company it keeps.",
            "link": null
          },
